OL,3,GNEWSAScot, 70, cross-stitched Bayeux
OL,4,ATapestry replica on his daily commute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tapestry is almost 1,000 years old
OL,7,Fand tells the story of the events
OL,8,Fleading to the Norman invasion of
OL,9,FEngland in 1066 as well as the Battle
OL,10,Fof Hastings.
